{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10122","headline":"冬夜饶州使堂饯相公五叔赴歙州 · 李嘉佑","name":"冬夜饶州使堂饯相公五叔赴歙州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丞相过邦牧，清弦送羽觞。\n高情同客醉，子夜爲人长。\n斜汉这过斗，寒云正护霜。\n新安江自绿，明主待惟良。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10122.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10122","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}